# Local402 has no root .env: each app or package reads its own.
# Copy the .env.example next to the one you run to .env and fill it in. Never commit a .env.
#
#   apps/demo-api/.env.example         the seller API (testnet demo on local402.xyz)
#   packages/facilitator/.env.example  the facilitator: verifies and settles payments
#   apps/agent/.env.example            an agent that pays a route
#   apps/mcp/.env.example              local402-mcp, the MCP server for agents
#   apps/mcp-seller/.env.example       the MCP seller example
#
# Stellar keys go in as placeholders here, never real ones:
# STELLAR_PRIVATE_KEY=S...
# PAY_TO=G...
